<title>USA: Essential Resources changes split date.</title>
<headline>Essential Resources changes split date.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Essential Resources Inc said it changed the pay date for its two-for-one stock split to September 20, from August 26.</p>
</text>
